6c8ebf'&gt;━━&lt;/font&gt; FK sem ação (app remove filhos / bloqueia exclusão)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#333333'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; FK &lt;i&gt;on delete cascade&lt;/i&gt; (filho do pedido)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#999999'&gt;╍╍&lt;/font&gt; FK &lt;i&gt;on delete set null&lt;/i&gt; (pedido guarda cópia de nome/preço)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pé de galinha no lado da FK = N; barra no lado da PK =&lt;br&gt;1 (FK not null) ou 0..1 (FK nullable).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt; chave primária · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; chave estrangeira · &lt;b&gt;UK&lt;/b&gt; unique&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Todas as PKs vêm de sequences &lt;i&gt;&amp;lt;tabela&amp;gt;_seq&lt;/i&gt; com incremento 50.&lt;br&gt;combo_product: unique (combo, product, product_size) via 2 índices parciais." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1970" y="120" width="330" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
